From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] riched20: selection movement, SetRange, TypeText; font SetDuplicate/IsEqual/CanChange (2041)

ITextSelection: SetRange (the anchor and the active end, clamped), GetType
(insertion point or normal selection), MoveLeft / MoveRight (characters and
words; a selection that is not extended collapses first, which counts as a
unit), MoveUp / MoveDown (lines), HomeKey / EndKey (line or story, with the
distance as the delta), TypeText (replaces the selection, read-only controls
refuse). ITextFont: SetDuplicate (on a font of a range it changes the
range), IsEqual and CanChange. All were stubs; they work through the same
editor calls as the keys.
---
--- a/dlls/riched20/richole.c
+++ b/dlls/riched20/richole.c
